; ribs first, then slip in the leaves and tofu so the cubes stay whole.&quot;]]],&quot;Drain half a 16 oz block of plain firm tofu. House Foods Premium Firm lists water, soybeans and calcium sulfate and carries a gluten-free label.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;Drain half a 16 oz block of plain &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;firm-tofu&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;firm tofu&quot;]}],[0,&quot;. House Foods Premium Firm lists &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;water&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;water&quot;]}],[0,&quot;, &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;soybean&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;soybeans&quot;]}],[0,&quot; and calcium sulfate and carries a gluten-free label.&quot;]]],&quot;3 oz fresh shiitake caps after removing the woody stems. Look near the fresh mushrooms in the produce aisle.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;3 oz fresh &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;shiitake&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;shiitake caps&quot;]}],[0,&quot; after removing the woody stems. Look near the fresh mushrooms in the produce aisle.&quot;]]],&quot;One small scallion, thinly sliced. Keep the white and green parts separate.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;One small &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;scallion&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;scallion&quot;]}],[0,&quot;, thinly sliced. Keep the white and green parts separate.&quot;]]],&quot;About 3 US cups drinking water for the soup.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;About 3 US cups drinking &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;water&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;water&quot;]}],[0,&quot; for the soup.&quot;]]],&quot;Fine table salt for the broth.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;Fine table &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;salt&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;salt&quot;]}],[0,&quot; for the broth.&quot;]]],&quot;A knife and board for the cabbage, mushrooms and tofu.&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;A knife and board for the &quot;],[0,{&quot;conceptId&quot;:[0,&quot;napa-cabbage&quot;],&quot;label&quot;:[0,&quot;cabbage&quot;]}]